摘要中的主要功能必须被所选片段支持。优先把改变用途含义的条件写进摘要，不能只藏在limitations。遇到“阶段1骨架”“cloud provider待实现”“匿名thread后续实现”等，摘要明确当前仅本地草稿/审批落盘，不说已实现匿名网络或云端发布。Codex/模型登录适配归coding-development；Oopz等语音房的对话连接归communication-integrations。自述兼容或性能用“作者称/README注明”，不冒充本次验证。
格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"a simple plugin to improve web UX/UI for \"Deepseek Harness (dsh)\"","id":"gh:1335253545","install_available":true,"language":"TypeScript","name":"dsh-better-sidebar-lite","slug":"pixellover1433/dsh-better-sidebar-lite","topics":["dsh-plugin","dsh-plugin-market","dsh-plugin-pack","dsh-plugin-verify","dsh-plugins"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"a simple plugin to improve web UX/UI for \"Deepseek Harness (dsh)\""},{"id":"p2s1","text":"**🌐 語言 / Language:** English · 繁體中文 · Tiếng Việt"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"# ;TLDR\nAdd a sidebar to the right side of the workspace screen with usefull tabs:\n- Explorer\n- Git\n"},{"id":"p3s2","text":"debar to the right side of the workspace screen with usefull tabs:\n- Explorer\n- Git\n- Skills\n- Tools"},{"id":"p4s1","text":"# How to install"},{"id":"p5s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p6s1","text":"⚠️ **WARNING:** Make sure to install Deepseek Harness version 0.1.0-rc.7 or higher..."},{"id":"p7s1","text":"# What is does ? (1.0.0-rs.1)\nAdd a sidebar to the right side of the workspace screen. This area wil"},{"id":"p7s2","text":"l contain tabs displaying various pieces of information, including:\n- **Dock**: A right-docked sideb"},{"id":"p7s3","text":"ar occupying the frame's right details column, with native drag resize. Open/close it with the `Ctrl"},{"id":"p7s4","text":"/Cmd+Shift+B` shortcut or the toggle button in the left sidebar footer; your open/closed preference "},{"id":"p7s5","text":"is persisted.\n- **Editor**: Modal editors support viewing the content of objects — a file viewer (ra"},{"id":"p7s6","text":"w content or unified-diff side-by-side view) and a tool-detail card, rendered over the whole sidebar"},{"id":"p7s7","text":".\n- **Explorer**:\n- Display the workspace folder tree, with directories lazy-loaded on demand.\n- Ope"},{"id":"p7s8","text":"n any file in the modal editor by double-clicking or pressing `Enter`.\n- Full keyboard navigation: a"},{"id":"p7s9","text":"rrow keys, `Home`/`End`, `Enter`/`Space`, and `*` to expand one level.\n- Automatically track changes"},{"id":"p7s10","text":" in the workspace (stamp polling + session-dirty debounce), with a manual refresh and empty/error st"},{"id":"p7s11","text":"ates (no workspace, deleted root, load failure).\n- **Git**:\n- Status view with four sections — Stage"},{"id":"p7s12","text":"d, Conflicts, Changes, Untracked — each with counts.\n- Stage/unstage per row, discard changes per fi"},{"id":"p7s13","text":"le or discard all.\n- Create commits (message via stdin; commit staged files or explicit paths).\n- Co"},{"id":"p7s14","text":"mmit history (newest-first, paginated \"Load more\") with a commit detail view listing the changed fil"},{"id":"p7s15","text":"es.\n- Per-file diff of a commit; double-click a file row to open a side-by-side diff view in the mod"},{"id":"p7s16","text":"al editor.\n- Automatically track changes, with not-a-repo / git-missing error states.\n- **Skills**:\n"},{"id":"p7s17","text":"- Will display a list of skills that the current agent (preset) has loaded/will load into.\n- View th"},{"id":"p7s18","text":"e list of skills of the current session along with their status (enable / disable)\n- View the conten"},{"id":"p7s19","text":"t of skills\n- View the reference files that skills use\n- **Tools**:\n- Tool catalog from the host too"},{"id":"p7s20","text":"l registry.\n- Category tags (builtin / mcp / agent) with a filter bar.\n- Double-click a tool to open"},{"id":"p7s21","text":" a tool-detail modal (category + MCP server + parameters).\n- Tabs are registered through an extensib"},{"id":"p7s22","text":"le tab registry, exposed as `ctx.betterSidebar`.\n- Synchronize the light/dark mode of your Deepseek "},{"id":"p7s23","text":"Harness profile (dsh theme tokens / `body[data-ds-dark-theme]`).\n- Allows for custom configurations "},{"id":"p7s24","text":"through the settings from the Deepseek Harness configuration interface (explorer poll/debounce, git "},{"id":"p7s25","text":"poll/debounce/timeout, skills poll, view-file dialog width).\n- English and 繁體中文 locales built in."},{"id":"p8s1","text":"# The author's vision and future direction."},{"id":"p9s1","text":"- Develop additional suitable features while maintaining the original philosophy of \"simplicity and "},{"id":"p9s2","text":"effectiveness\".\n- Share additional plugins, system prompts, and other skills suitable for the Deepse"},{"id":"p9s3","text":"ek Harness system.\n- Support and contribute to the Deepseek Harness community.\n- Complete the challe"},{"id":"p9s4","text":"nge set for myself: 365 days (and beyond) of partnership with Deepseek Harness."},{"id":"p10s1","text":"# Printshot"}],"truncated":false}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
